# Community themes go here / 社区主题放这个目录
#
# One folder per theme, named after its id:
# 每套主题一个文件夹，文件夹名就是主题 id：
#
#   themes/community/<id>/
#     theme.toml            required — id, name, eight colors / 必填
#     assets/ring.png       optional artwork / 可选素材
#     assets/needle.png
#     assets/dial.png
#     preview.png           optional screen photo / 可选预览图
#
# Then append one line to ../registry.txt (append only!).
# 然后往 ../registry.txt 末尾追加一行（只能追加！）。
#
# Full guide: ../README.md  (bilingual 中英双语)
